	"data": "Homelab Infrastructure (2025 Build)\n\nWhat It Is\nThe systematic buildout of cithoreal's self-hosted personal infrastructure during mid-2025. This is the \"proving ground phase\" of the Cybernautics vision — everything from Git server to AI pipelines to backup strategy.\n\nStack Decisions (2025)\n\n| Layer | Technology | Decision Date |\n|-------|-----------|--------------|\n| Container orchestration | Docker + Compose | Ongoing |\n| Reverse proxy | Caddy | Jun 2025 |\n| Git server | Forgejo (over Gitea) |…",
